## Next Steps

To enable Web Analytics:
1. Deploy this project to Vercel
2. Enable Web Analytics in the Vercel dashboard under your project's Analytics tab
3. Analytics will automatically start tracking page views and events

## Notes

- The project also has `@vercel/speed-insights` installed and configured, which is complementary to Web Analytics
